{
  "title": "NAIS Functional Demo — Kubeflow, MLflow & GPU Operations",
  "uid": "nais-mlflow-functional-demo",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "tags": ["nais", "kubeflow", "mlflow", "functional-demo", "gpu"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {"from": "now-1h", "to": "now"},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MLflow tracking server",
      "description": "1이면 단일 MLflow Deployment가 사용 가능 상태입니다.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "max(kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=\"science-ai-mlops\",deployment=\"mlflow\"}) or vector(0)", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "max": 1, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Functional run completed",
      "description": "MLflow에 parameter, metric, artifact, model version을 남기는 Job 성공 횟수입니다.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "max(kube_job_status_succeeded{namespace=\"science-ai-mlops\",job_name=\"mlflow-functional-demo\"}) or vector(0)", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "max": 1, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MinIO artifact store",
      "description": "기존 Kubeflow artifact store의 StatefulSet ready replica입니다.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "max(kube_statefulset_status_replicas_ready{namespace=\"science-ai-mlops\",statefulset=\"minio\"}) or vector(0)", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "max": 1, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ready cluster nodes",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum(kube_node_status_condition{condition=\"Ready\",status=\"true\"})", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Physical GPU utilization",
      "description": "DCGM exporter가 수집한 실제 GPU 사용률입니다.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL", "legendFormat": "{{modelName}} / GPU {{gpu}}", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percent", "min": 0, "max": 100}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Physical GPU framebuffer used",
      "description": "DCGM exporter가 수집한 실제 GPU framebuffer 사용량입니다.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "DCGM_FI_DEV_FB_USED", "legendFormat": "{{modelName}} / GPU {{gpu}}", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "decmbytes"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "KFP → MLflow run succeeded",
      "description": "MLflow Run, artifact, candidate model을 생성한 KFP component pod가 성공했으면 1입니다.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 14},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "max(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"kubeflow\",pod=~\"nais-kfp-mlflow-integration-.*-system-container-impl-.*\",phase=\"Succeeded\"}) or vector(0)", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "max": 1, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "KFP component duration",
      "description": "실제 train/register component pod의 시작부터 완료까지 걸린 시간입니다.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 14},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "max(kube_pod_completion_time{namespace=\"kubeflow\",pod=~\"nais-kfp-mlflow-integration-.*-system-container-impl-.*\"} - kube_pod_start_time{namespace=\"kubeflow\",pod=~\"nais-kfp-mlflow-integration-.*-system-container-impl-.*\"}) or vector(0)", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Kubeflow Pipelines UI",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 14},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "max(kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=\"kubeflow\",deployment=\"ml-pipeline-ui\"}) or vector(0)", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "max": 1, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Kueue pending workloads",
      "description": "대기 workload가 없거나 metric이 비어 있으면 0으로 표시합니다.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 14},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"expr": "sum(kueue_pending_workloads) or vector(0)", "refId": "A"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto"}
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Demo scope",
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 19},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "### 기능 실증 범위\n- Kubeflow Pipeline CPU component 실제 실행\n- MLflow experiment / run / parameter / metric / artifact\n- MAE threshold gate 통과 후 registered model version + `candidate` alias\n- Grafana KFP 성공·실행시간 및 live Prometheus/DCGM panels\n\nKFP run `9e23aab6-9b9c-4b52-bdca-079a998b575b`와 MLflow run `5e9e2e422403454f9548b146dcc33396`로 검증했습니다. 단일 인스턴스 SQLite/PVC 구성으로, 고가용성·원격 DR은 이번 실증 범위가 아닙니다."}
    }
  ],
  "templating": {"list": []},
  "annotations": {"list": []}
}
